{"id":213013104511993,"type":"artist","name":"Aimee Mann","artist":null,"year":1960,"weight":12,"info":{"country":"US","begin":"1960-09-08","kind":"Person","similar":["Tori Amos","Ani DiFranco","Michael Penn","Natalie Merchant","Juliana Hatfield","Beth Orton","Suzanne Vega","Heather Nova","Neko Case","Liz Phair"],"img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/c962d365b3b529796287d25cd9238f89/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"Desde su trabajo en los años 80 con el favorito de MTV Til Tuesday hasta sus aclamados discos en solitario ”Whatever” y “I’m With Stupid” en los 90, Aimee Mann siempre ha estado a la vanguardia de los compositores contemporáneos. El final del milenio le trajo su mayor éxito, con los lanzamientos simultáneos de “Bachelor nº 2” y la banda sonora de la película Magnolia, que fue nominada a un Oscar, un Globo de Oro y tres Grammys.","tags":["female vocalists","singer-songwriter","indie","alternative","rock"]},"works":[{"id":172336393329613,"type":"album","name":"Whatever","artist":"Aimee Mann","year":1993,"weight":9,"yt":"-B8hTJlExJ0","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":144801247485670,"name":"Pitchfork: The 150 Best Albums of the 1990s","rank":143,"scaruffi":null},{"id":192934750972716,"name":"1001 Albums You Must Hear Before You Die","rank":739,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":134189779518137,"type":"album","name":"I'm With Stupid","artist":"Aimee Mann","year":1995,"weight":6,"yt":"sTm7aZE6u6w","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":66023912151541,"type":"album","name":"Bachelor No.2 (Or the Last Remains...)","artist":"Aimee Mann","year":2000,"weight":7,"yt":"h09_3egMFmc","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":44456762010629,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 2000","rank":197,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":265262269149770,"type":"album","name":"Los